# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Pages serves a matching asset first and only reaches this file when nothing
# matched, so /main-A1B2C3.js is served as itself and /app/schedule falls
# through to here. The trailing 200 is the whole point: without it Pages
# answers the deep link with a 404 status, the router still renders the right
# screen, and every crawler, uptime check and cache is told the page does not
# exist.
#
# Consumed by Pages and never served. Inert on Azure Blob, where the same job
# is done by a Front Door rewrite rule.
